Quiet Reader

The popup reader is adapted from:
  fashionzzZ/linuxdo-read-script
  https://github.com/fashionzzZ/linuxdo-read-script
  Original file: LinuxDo 增强阅读.user.js
  Original version: 2.0.0
  Source revision: 7e7f53ab7a25f454f65bfafdefc3d5b1f7972800
  Copyright (c) 2026 Fashion
  License: MIT (see LICENSE)

Modifications include a configurable control panel, feature gates, cancellable
reader sessions, sequential popup browsing, optional automatic scrolling,
optional likes, explicit pause/stop controls, and update metadata.

The control-panel and automation modules are newly implemented for this project.
The external automation scripts discussed during development were reviewed for
behavioral requirements; their automation code is not bundled in this release.

Some optional media/math features inherited from the reader load third-party
assets at runtime. Those assets are not distributed by this repository and
retain their respective licenses.
